  EVERY COPY (release layer, the lead's separate step; MEASURED by grep, no hits
  under hooks/, scripts/ or tests/ other than the count pin): skills/vllm-neuron-parity/SKILL.md
  lines 91, 92, 94, 96, 153, 158 and 159 name the three folded nodes in the dispatch
