changelog_entry: >-
  Graph revision 19 (`history/v19.patch`, kind graph): three folds, nothing added.
  Host recovery becomes a mode of prepare_host (recovery allowance, shared-lease wait,
  identity-first sequence and boot-identifier amendment kept as its Recovery
  paragraph; the attempt loop's host_faulted enters it directly). Procedure building
  and the read-only baseline capture become the first two steps of measure_candidate
  (comparators_preregistered stays on the entry edge, procedures_smoke_verified moves
  to the exit edge into adjudication, the defect loop becomes an in-node repair under
  the same shared budget, bundles_stable requires the procedure and baseline records).
  The route review becomes the first step of assemble_kickoff_contracts by a retained
  reviewer seat independent of the costing seat, with material_findings routed to
  costing before gate 1 is presented. The fourth fold, trace_target_delta into
  costing, is declined: PAVE fan-out is an edge construct and the per-target trace
  must stay parallel. 21 nodes become 18, 68 edges become 61, 68 outcomes become 61;
  check, evidence, role, control-node and state counts unchanged, with roles, state,
  write_limits and principles byte-equal; 2820 lines become 2738 under the 3100
  ceiling. Release copies (SKILL.md
  dispatch table and stage map, README diagram and counts, agent files and their
  codex mirrors, artifact-layout owner names, the test's count pin) follow in the
  release step.
